      "text": [
        "Electrical Services for Homes & Businesses",
        "From a flickering light switch to a full rewire, our team handles domestic and light commercial electrical work to the highest standard.",
        "Domestic Rewiring",
        "Full and partial rewires for houses and flats, including period properties, with minimal mess and disruption to your home.",
        "Fuse Boxes & Consumer Units",
        "Upgrades and replacements to modern, RCD-protected consumer units for improved safety and reliability.",
        "EICR & Landlord Certificates",
        "Electrical Installation Condition Reports for landlords, buyers and sellers, with same-day certification available.",
        "EV Charger Installation",
        "OZEV-approved home and workplace EV charge point installation, wall-mounted or freestanding.",
        "Lighting & Sockets",
        "Downlights, outdoor lighting, extra sockets and USB points, plus smart lighting and dimmer installations.",
        "Commercial & Retail",
        "Fit-outs, PAT testing, emergency lighting and periodic testing for shops, salons, offices and small units.",
        "Fault Finding & Repairs",
        "Tripping breakers, dead sockets, and intermittent faults diagnosed and fixed quickly and safely.",
        "Smoke & Fire Alarm Systems",
        "Interlinked smoke, heat and CO alarm installation to current Building Regulations standards.",
        "Emergency Call-Outs",
        "Power cuts, burning smells or exposed wiring — our on-call electricians are available around the clock.",
        "What We Do"
      ]
    },
