      "text": [
        "What Our Customers Say",
        "\"Called RMP after our fuse box kept tripping. They came out the same afternoon, explained everything clearly, and had it sorted within a couple of hours. Really fair price too.\"",
        "\"Had an EV charger fitted at our house in Gerrards Cross. Tidy work, all cabling hidden neatly, and they left everything spotless. Would use again without hesitation.\"",
